# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PaperForge .gitignore
#
# Layout rule: source, tests, test data and the pinned tectonic cache are
# tracked; everything the application *generates* (project data, build
# workspaces, autosave snapshots, screenshots, scratch captures) is not.
# See docs/REPOSITORY.md for the full layout contract.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- Build output ---------------------------------------------------------

# CTest scratch when run from the source root
Testing/
/build/
/build-*/
/generated/
compile_commands.json

# ---- TeX runtime (rebuilt with tools/build-runtime/build_runtime.sh) ------
# The portable TeX Live is ~265MB of binaries; it is reproducible from the
# scripts in tools/build-runtime/ and is therefore never committed (plan §33).
/runtime/

# ---- Runtime project data (never source) ----------------------------------
# A project directory the app writes while you experiment. /tmp is the
# recommended place for throwaway projects; these entries only exist to keep
# accidental ones out of `git diff`.
/project.paper
/.paperforge/
/GMVG2/
/GMVG3/
MyPaper/
.paperforge/
*.paper.tmp-*

# ---- Scratch captures -----------------------------------------------------
/Screenshot*.png
/assets/Screenshot*.png
*.log

# ---- Editor / tooling -----------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.cache/
.clang-format
